    "image": "Photorealistic cinematic 16:9 peak reaction immediately after the third shot. Preserve the radical 24 mm worm's-eye camera under the wet platform railing from final-08c-1, now at a stronger Dutch angle. The platform has dropped and twisted a few centimeters. Exact Czeslaw is slammed sideways and backward into his fastened harness; one shoulder falls, torso folds against the belts and BOTH correct hands desperately retain separate controls. Wet glasses are strongly crooked, mouth open in a raw involuntary gasp, forehead knotted, eyes wide and looking DOWN toward the groaning roof rather than at camera. Saturated PINK-RED residual light flashes across one side of helmet, glasses and cheek. Wet roof grit, concrete dust and droplets erupt through the platform, one cable snaps taut and a small steam jet begins. Genuine terror that the building is collapsing, no hero pose, neutral portrait, extra hands, blue or yellow light, text, UI or watermark.",
    "endFrameDescription": "Dla opcjonalnej pętli dokładny powrót do własnej niskiej kotwicy final-08c-1 revision 2. W montażu liniowym końcowa chwila nadal zawiera narastający metaliczny jęk i pierwszą parę prowadzącą do przegrzania.",
